msgid "[!WARNING] Every failure, an invalid argument or an overflow, is returned as `0`. A returned non-zero value is the exact sum; `0` is either the sum or a failure. With $w = c = 1$ every input longer than one element fails. When you need to tell the cases apart, use `execute_scan_sum_i32` and take its last element."
