msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:61
msgid "The module uses the `moon.mod` and `moon.pkg` manifest syntax and needs the MoonBit toolchain 0.10 or later (`moonc` ≥ 0.10). Running the facade needs the `native` target and a C compiler; the build links the C runtime from the package's native stubs and uses POSIX threads. Building the standalone C runtime with OpenMP uses CMake, and the Node.js addon uses `node-gyp`; `scripts/check-env.sh` checks for all of them."
